  "limitations": [
    "Local duration admission and exact failure receipt only, not a full atomic beat.",
    "Migration requests are typed declarations, not crossing or target-profile admission.",
    "Source-state digest is a supplied evidence identity; this leaf cannot authenticate a live scientific state.",
    "No GRC9 expansion, harness injection, snapshot/pickle restoration, executable facade or runtime support.",
    "Final maintenance/UX checks are separate tool executions after publication binding; no full historical/D11 replay is claimed.",
    "Receipt content validity does not identify the full request, authenticate an observer or prove causal stage/code execution; downstream binding checks are assigned, not implemented here."
  ],
